# Build output
bin/
obj/
bin-fl/
artifacts/
*.user

# Visual Studio
.vs/

# Harness output.
#
# Probe, proof, first-light and diagnostic runs write their records into this folder: text
# logs, screenshots, and the flag files that switch a sample page into measurement mode. Every
# one of them is the record of one run on one machine, not source, and none of them means
# anything to the next person.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so this stays confined to the repository root. Without it the
# image rules would swallow the sample's own Assets/*.png — its splash screen and tile logos,
# which are real project content and must stay tracked.
/*.txt
/*.png
/*.bmp

# Written anywhere: presence switches a sample page into its measurement pass, which runs and
# then exits. Committing one would make the sample unusable for whoever cloned it.
*-diag.flag

# Screenshots captured by the run-and-prove passes.
docs/proof/
